This entry owns no authority. It never creates an approval, once token, model,
Study, or solver action. Optional numerical reads still pass through the
ordinary MCP gateway -> control client -> ControlDaemon -> Worker route. Every
request intent and raw response is append-only and fsynced before proceeding.
